  "description": "Ever since being disowned by his religious parents for being gay, Kwon Yi-Hyeon has been all alone. After nine years, he believes he has gotten used to this life until he runs into Gu Seung-Hyeok, an old wound from high school. Now a ruthless gangster, Seung-Hyeok is just as cold to Yi-Hyeon as the winter they have reunited in. But when Yi-Hyeon enters a contract deal with Seung-Hyeok due to his financial troubles, perhaps their frosty relationship could turn into hope of a spring to come...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
